{
"file": 201,
"paths": [
"d007/d008/f093"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "3cfcbd7e",
"en_raw": "Hey Yuri, it happened again, they say"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "0560caae",
"en_raw": "The Shin-Oji Line accident, right?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "572b6bd3",
"en_raw": "I heard the announcement"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "c112f831",
"en_raw": "Something about recovering the body"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "3020dd09",
"en_raw": "Yeah, well, can't be helped"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "9e7d9457",
"en_raw": "The line itself"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "6c20f50c",
"en_raw": "is cursed"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "17dcf73e",
"en_raw": "...It's cursed?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "d77899e8",
"en_raw": "A crossing where a legless ghost appears"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "3c1065a5",
"en_raw": "A platform with a mother's voice calling children"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "1ef4c12c",
"en_raw": "A station bathroom full of Mizuko"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "86791530",
"en_raw": "Not to mention the accidents"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "e460c727",
"en_raw": "Anyway, it's not just Hirumi Station"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "07fa88e0",
"en_raw": "the Shin-Oji Line's tracks themselves"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "cbfe348e",
"en_raw": "go against the flow of energy"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "df324544",
"en_raw": "as they were laid"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "4ae49b55",
"en_raw": "so they easily attract bad things"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "76b3857f",
"en_raw": "Hey, Yuri, what about the underpass?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "7fdeb0c9",
"en_raw": "Well, that place is certainly"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "dd4bb7e7",
"en_raw": "not a good place either"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "6a880dd8",
"en_raw": "but not as big a deal as the rumors"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "6f82b679",
"en_raw": "Hmm, I see"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "e960d370",
"en_raw": "As expected of Yuri"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "62c3f4f9",
"en_raw": "Kurumi saw it too"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "5afbf9cc",
"en_raw": "What, alien?"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "5a66c4b8",
"en_raw": "All you can see are"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "4275578a",
"en_raw": "Water Flea people, right?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "831f8d7d",
"en_raw": "You see, under the train"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "07583e67",
"en_raw": "Kurumi saw something black"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "3bfb7772",
"en_raw": "Is this kid talking about"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "0f7c430e",
"en_raw": "the underpass?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "922899e0",
"en_raw": "What do you mean, black?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "42c471b1",
"en_raw": "Ignore her, Yuri"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "8998bc62",
"en_raw": "Black is black"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "2661a5b0",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't get it"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "aba82640",
"en_raw": "...What is that?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "08df60f5",
"en_raw": "There's no such thing"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "e07b1532",
"en_raw": "What's there is..."
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "00ec634c",
"en_raw": "the spirits of eleven people"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "c0b00418",
"en_raw": "When I walked through the station north to south"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "23d560c1",
"en_raw": "I counted as I walked"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "0733c02e",
"en_raw": "Eleven... spirits?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "5909fd9e",
"en_raw": "Well, it's pointless telling"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "ae2f8820",
"en_raw": "people who can't see"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "d05d9522",
"en_raw": "Anyway, that's all there is under the underpass"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "58740187",
"en_raw": "...What about the black thing?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "a64aa19b",
"en_raw": "I don't know about that"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "f0065013",
"en_raw": "What's really there"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "1f53fd8a",
"en_raw": "is the Shin-Oji Line curse"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "ea6a8db9",
"en_raw": "If you get it, go away"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "11f3c361",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the Shin-Oji Line Curse"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "891e696d",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, what are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "3a5df789",
"en_raw": "Aliens, go away"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "418f19b7",
"en_raw": "There are people like that"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "fde20ed8",
"en_raw": "who don't understand"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "162abe76",
"en_raw": "and talk about black vibes..."
}
]
}